cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the characterisation it certifies, please cite it as below."
title: "Exact characterisation and certification of the sharp two-sided Cheeger--Buser bound for finite weighted graphs"
abstract: >-
  Exact characterisation, certified computation and exhaustive verification of
  the two-sided Cheeger--Buser comparison between the second eigenvalue of the
  normalised Laplacian and the Cheeger constant of a finite weighted graph with
  self-loops. Includes a sharpness family attaining the extremal coefficient
  exactly, and an exact-arithmetic verification pipeline.
type: software
authors:
